<title>USA: KISTA, Ballard Cty SD, Ky., won by Belle Haven.</title>
<headline>KISTA, Ballard Cty SD, Ky., won by Belle Haven.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belle Haven Investments, LP said it won $3.600 million of Kentucky Interlocal School Transportation Association for Ballard County School District, Ky., various lease program revenue bonds, 1997 Series G, with a net interest cost of 4.506 percent.</p>
</text>
